<title>POLAND: EXBUD Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>EXBUD Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exbud preliminary results</p>
<p>for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.82 vs	1.17</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   4.58 vs	1.98</p>
<p>    net profit				 3.13 vs	1.71</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Exbud SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 57.67 vs     52.46</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  49.59 vs     47.10</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.45 vs	0.25</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     9.54 vs	4.86</p>
<p>    financial costs			  6.79 vs	4.04</p>
<p>    investment				10.00 vs	2.16</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
